WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.222
SimDrop

00:00:01.305 --> 00:00:02.861
Running iOS simulators

00:00:02.673 --> 00:00:03.699
in the macOS

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:04.595
Finder sidebar

00:00:05.118 --> 00:00:06.474
Shows running iOS

00:00:06.285 --> 00:00:07.287
simulators in the

00:00:07.099 --> 00:00:08.195
Finder sidebar

00:00:08.243 --> 00:00:08.820
so you can

00:00:08.632 --> 00:00:09.846
drag files in

00:00:09.658 --> 00:00:10.212
and out of

00:00:10.024 --> 00:00:10.495
them

00:00:11.014 --> 00:00:12.240
SimDrop isn't on

00:00:12.052 --> 00:00:12.759
the Mac App

00:00:12.571 --> 00:00:13.667
Store and can't

00:00:13.479 --> 00:00:13.891
be

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:14.870
the app and

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:15.636
its helper must

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:16.863
run unsandboxed to

00:00:16.674 --> 00:00:17.924
drive simctl and

00:00:17.748 --> 00:00:19.268
the simulators' folders

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:20.851
Replacing the app

00:00:20.674 --> 00:00:22.054
makes macOS drop

00:00:21.877 --> 00:00:23.139
its Finder extension

00:00:23.233 --> 00:00:24.035
and stop the

00:00:23.847 --> 00:00:24.931
background helper

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:26.308
launchd refuses to

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:27.027
start a helper

00:00:26.863 --> 00:00:28.041
whose recorded launch

00:00:27.853 --> 00:00:29.032
constraint came from

00:00:28.844 --> 00:00:29.857
the old copy

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:31.404
Full story on

00:00:31.215 --> 00:00:32.111
the dashboard
